<LegalPage title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for visitors to Top Crypto Airdrops." path="/privacy/" kicker="PRIVACY / DATA USE">
  <p>This page describes the minimum information used to operate the directory. We do not request wallet addresses, private keys, seed phrases, or financial account credentials.</p>
  <h2>Operational data</h2>
  <p>Hosting providers may process standard technical logs such as IP address, browser type, request time, and requested URL for security and reliability. Analytics or advertising tools will only be added with the disclosures and consent required for the target audience.</p>
  <h2>External sites</h2>
  <p>Project and source links lead to third-party sites with their own policies. Review a destination's domain and privacy terms before interacting with it.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions can be sent to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:editorial@topcryptoairdrops.com">editorial@topcryptoairdrops.com</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
